      "createdAt": null,
      "updatedAt": null,
      "cookedHtml": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Xfmmda\" data-post=\"20\" data-topic=\"3003356\" role=\"none\" data-expanded=\"false\">\n    \n  <div class=\"title\" data-can-navigate-to-post=\"/t/topic/3003356/20\" data-can-toggle-quote=\"\" data-has-quote-controls=\"/t/topic/3003356/20\">\n\n<img alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://cdn.ldstatic.com/user_avatar/linux.do/xfmmda/48/2798915_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Xfmmda:<div class=\"quote-controls\"><button aria-controls=\"quote-id-3003356-20-0\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-label=\"展开\" class=\"btn no-text btn-flat quote-toggle\" title=\"展开\" type=\"button\">\n<!----><!---->\n<svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-chevron-down svg-icon fa-width-auto svg-string\" width=\"1em\" height=\"1em\" aria-hidden=\"true\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><use href=\"#chevron-down\"></use></svg>\n\n<!----></button><a aria-label=\"转到引用的帖子\" class=\"btn no-text btn-flat back\" href=\"https://linux.do/t/topic/3003356/20\" title=\"转到引用的帖子\">\n<!----><!---->\n<svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-arrow-up svg-icon fa-width-auto svg-string\" width=\"1em\" height=\"1em\" aria-hidden=\"true\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><use href=\"#arrow-up\"></use></svg>\n\n<!----></a></div></div>\n  <blockquote id=\"quote-id-3003356-20-0\"><div class=\"post__contents-cooked-quote\">\n<p dir=\"auto\">违背初衷</p>\n</div><!----></blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p dir=\"auto\">它最早的初衷，就是饥饿营销。当时手感太差</p><div class=\"cooked-selection-barrier\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><br></div>",
